  "sort_date": "2026-11-19 17:34:02",
  "symbol": "TCS",
  "voiceSummary": "Tata Consultancy Services Limited has published a newspaper advertisement regarding a special window for the transfer and dematerialization of physical shares. The window for lodgement of transfer requests is open from February 5, 2026, to February 4, 2027. Investors whose transfer deeds were executed before April 1, 2019, but were not lodged or were rejected due to document deficiencies, are eligible to apply. Securities transferred to the Investor Education Protection Fund, cases with disputes, and those lacking original share certificates are not eligible. Applicants must submit original share certificates and transfer deeds executed prior to April 1, 2019, to the Registrar and Share Transfer Agent, MUFG Intime India Private Limited. The issued shares will be in demat form and subject to a one-year lock-in period.",
